From 1a767248a6a2a33dacb11451c0b15293bff082f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Kinsy <mrkinsy5@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:02:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] site: list released Pigpen Packages and Piglets on /packages

New sources Pigpen Packages and Pigpen Piglets from Pigpen's generated index.json
(scripts/build-pigpen-catalog.mjs): validated against Pigpen's schema, only available
entries, every install/pull command and URL re-derived from the entry's identity and refused
when it differs, committed snapshot as the fallback. Cards show the exact command, the
Binary platforms and the signing key of a Piglet. No downloads are hosted.

Signed-off-by: Michael Kinsy <mrkinsy5@gmail.com>
